<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:black">I renew my request for a=
 fee waiver on public interest grounds under ORS 192.324(5) as to both requ=
ests. I am not seeking these records for any commercial purpose.<o:p></o:p>=
</span></p>
